{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_quartz_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_quartz_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "無需遺憾",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_quartz_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4b2d419bc65b9dce0b73eb274b03069a17db72513c14225a0dedccb815c0ba6c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "艾維，你在後面跟緊我，不要被人群撞倒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "再堅持一下，等到了安全的地方我就給你處理傷口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "唔......鎮長那個混蛋，簡直是瘋了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "商店裡那麼多人，他居然也敢放火，根本不在乎大家是死是活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "怪不得你每次提到他，都說他是個惡棍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "沒錯，他和他手下的那些傭兵都是一群惡棍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "大家平常都躲著他們，可還是會莫名其妙地被找上門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "我們走這邊，這邊人少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "text": "欸欸，小姑娘，你先站住，跑什麼跑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "text": "今天的零錢呢？嗯？有嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "喂，大叔你還真是......這個時候還不忘找我要錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "你還坐在這裡，等下鎮長的人就過來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "text": "我一老頭要啥沒啥，我怕什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "text": "你們兩個才是，害怕什麼呢？跑這麼急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "text": "惹麻煩的也不是你們，不然能讓你們跑這麼遠？跑什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "艾維，我們走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "呼——終於到家了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "艾維，讓我看下你的傷口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "（還好傷得不深，先簡單處理一下，把血止住。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "除了腿上，你還有其他地方受傷了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "嗯......我沒事，就是有點喘不上氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "那個混蛋......太可惡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "真希望有一天能有人狠狠地教訓他一頓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "啊，爸爸！我們回來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "我聽說出了亂子，結果你們兩個偏偏這個時候不見了蹤影，急死人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "怎麼還受了傷，怎麼搞的？你們到底幹什麼去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "鎮長發現有人背著他進私貨，不僅把人打了，還放火燒了那人的店鋪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "我和艾維當時就在店裡，跑出來的時候，艾維意外受了傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "鎮長......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "我不是提醒過你們兩個，最近不要出門，老老實實在家待著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "我只是......想買個禮物送給石英姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "她馬上要走了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "不要解釋，你就回答我，我是不是說過，這幾天老實待在家裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "嗯......爸爸你說過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "那你自己說，錯了沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "......我錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大嬸",
      "text": "行了，艾維都受傷了，你還在兇她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大嬸",
      "text": "艾維，快過來讓我看看，傷得嚴重不嚴重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "媽媽！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "我沒什麼事，你看！而且石英姐姐一直在保護我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大嬸",
      "text": "嗯？那你得好好謝謝石英姐姐，但是你更得聽你爸的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "石英姐姐，謝謝你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "我該道歉才是，畢竟這次出門，也是因為我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "皮克特大叔，對不起，給你們添麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "唉......算了，也是多虧你在旁邊，艾維才沒出什麼大事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大嬸",
      "text": "石英，你明天就要走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大嬸",
      "text": "你愛吃什麼？晚上我給你做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "石英姐姐......你不能留下來嗎？我不想你離開......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "爸爸，可以讓石英姐姐留在我們家嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾維",
      "text": "哪怕只有明天，再多一天，好不好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "小艾維，以後我一定會回來看你的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "皮克特大叔，這些日子謝謝你們的照顧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "麻煩了你們這麼久，我也是時候出發了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "哼，你別謝我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "實話說，我還巴不得你趕快走呢。艾維每天跟著你，我都擔心她會學壞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "真不知道你父母怎麼會同意你一個人跑到這危險的荒野上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "他們啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "我的母親應該也會想從家裡出來到處看看吧，不過......從來沒有機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "我的父親肯定不會同意，他和大叔你一樣，經常念叨著外面有多麼危險，雖然他也沒有說錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "你知道還一個人跑出來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "這裡的人，上一秒能在那些傳教的黎博利面前痛哭流涕，痛斥自己做過的那些糟糕的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "可一扭頭，就能為了手裡的一杯啤酒，桌子上的一把賭局，家裡的一頭瘤獸而鬧得你死我活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "最近鎮子周圍也經常有補給的車隊和拓荒隊被流匪襲擊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "鎮長自己就是個惡棍，警察局的老文森更是派不上用場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "這裡什麼事情都有可能發生，也隨時都有可能發生。到時候更不會有人來幫你，明白嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "你要是沒別的什麼事情，早點回家吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "行了，也不知道現在幾點，估計也不早了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "九點，對面商店的人每天差不多這個時候關門，我剛剛聽到他們搬東西的聲音了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "嗯？哦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "那你抓緊收拾完行李就休息吧，我還得去給那個老混蛋送貨......真是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "text": "明天注意安全，早點回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "九點了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "按照以往的時間，的確該休息了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "不想睡覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "可是也不知道該做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "（那是父親修理屋頂時的聲音。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "這下應該沒問題了，你媽媽晚上也可以好好休息了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "石英！你在幹什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "認真點，仔細看我是怎麼弄的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "這些事情你以後都要開始學著做，知道嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "（那是上門討債的惡徒敲門的聲音。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "滾出去！誰允許你們上我們家來的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "欠的錢我自然會還，但是你們誰要是敢上門來找麻煩，我絕不跟你們客氣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "石英，看到了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "你以後也要保護好你媽媽，不管是誰都不要怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "我不可能永遠擋在你的前面，更不會有別人來幫你，一切都要靠你自己了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "該死！窗戶外面這麼亮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "今天居然起得這麼晚，太不應該了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "我還得......還得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "text": "（不對，是有人在敲門的聲音。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
